flowchart LR
  Client[CLI / frontend / Python / Node] --> Request[POST /v1/sql]
  Request --> Auth[Bearer auth and principal]
  Auth --> Parse[Parser and AST]
  Parse --> Bind[Binder, catalog resolution, type checks, SQL authorization]
  Bind --> Bound[BoundStatement]
  Bound --> Plan[Logical/physical plan and validation]
  Plan --> Exec[Execution operators]
  Exec --> Tx[Transaction / TableStore / IndexBuilder]
  Tx --> Storage[LSM storage path]
  Exec --> Result[Typed rows, write, DDL, or error]
  Result --> Client
